  "description": "Demolition of existing rear extension and erection of a single-storey rear extension and formation of a rear lightwell",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed rear extension, by virtue of its depth, height and siting would have a detrimental impact on the amenity enjoyed by the neighbouring occupiers at No.90 Northwold Road in respect of loss of light, outlook, an increased sense of enclosure and overbearing impact. As such the proposed development is contrary to policies D1 (London’s form, character and capacity for growth) and D6 (Housing quality and standards) of the London Plan (2021) and policy LP2 (Development and amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020)."
  ],
